# Route for the 4K game. One shot per still and per movie. The movie frames are identical to the reference content only
# in the sense that the decoders and the time of the first frame differ between engines, so the movie shots are volatile
# (compared, reported, never failing).
# Ops: cmd TEXT | wait TOKEN | settle SECS | shot NAME [volatile] | note TEXT | quit
cmd auto on
cmd click on
wait menu True
cmd click off
settle 3
shot 01-menu
cmd start
after_start
cmd advance-to 1
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 02-bg-png
cmd advance-to 2
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 03-bg-webp
cmd advance-to 3
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 04-bg-avif
cmd advance-to 4
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 05-sprite-png
cmd advance-to 5
wait advance-done
settle 2
shot 06-sprite-webp
cmd advance-to 6
wait advance-done
settle 3
shot 07-movie-vp9-fullscreen volatile
cmd advance-to 7
wait advance-done
settle 3
shot 08-movie-av1-1080p volatile
quit
